



 📝 To-Do List Web Application

A lightweight and user-friendly **To-Do List** application built with **HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript**.  
Designed to demonstrate clean UI, DOM manipulation, and basic front-end best practices.

 🌟 Overview

This project allows users to efficiently manage daily tasks by adding, completing, and removing items from a list.  
It is ideal for beginners learning JavaScript as well as for showcasing fundamental front-end skills on GitHub.

🚀 Features

- Add new tasks instantly
- Mark tasks as completed
- Delete tasks easily
- Clean and minimal UI
- Responsive and browser-compatible
- No external libraries required

 🧰 Tech Stack

- **HTML5** – Structure  
- **CSS3** – Styling  
- **JavaScript (ES6)** – Logic & DOM manipulation  

